Package: depot-capslock
Version: 1.1.0
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-pango-1.0
Recommends: fonts-inter
Maintainer: nguyenquocanhz <nguyenquocanhz@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/nguyenquocanhz/depot-os
Description: on-screen Caps Lock and Num Lock indicator from Depot OS
 Shows a small rounded box with a padlock for a second each time Caps Lock
 or Num Lock is switched: closed padlock when on, open padlock when off,
 with "A" / "a" for Caps Lock and "Num" for Num Lock inside the padlock.
 .
 The box is drawn with cairo (no icon theme needed), never takes keyboard
 focus and lets mouse clicks through. It starts with the desktop session
 and works on any X11 desktop: XFCE, MATE, Cinnamon, LXQt, i3, Openbox.
 "depot-capslock --check-update" asks the GitHub repository for a newer
 version and "--update" downloads and installs it.
 .
 Ô báo Caps Lock và Num Lock của Depot OS đóng thành gói riêng: ổ khoá đóng
 khi bật, ổ khoá mở khi tắt; chữ A / a cho Caps Lock, chữ Num cho Num Lock.
 Trên Depot OS, phím nào depot-notify đã tự báo thì gói nhường phím đó,
 không hiện hai lần.
